m4trace:gnuscripts/libtool.m4:1631: -1- AC_DEFUN([AC_LIBTOOL_COMPILER_OPTION], [m4_warn([obsolete], [The macro 'AC_LIBTOOL_COMPILER_OPTION' is obsolete.
